[PrintTextModified Text:晚餐后，放风时间到了。|#0203Adv10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:冲完澡后，<br>我在二楼的过道漫无目的地散步。|#0203Adv10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要不去图书室看看……<br>　说不定能发现什么跟大魔女<br>　有关系的线索）|#0203Adv10_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

; ガタッという物音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_64 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我前往图书室的路上，<br>画室中传来了声响。|#0203Adv10_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（画室里有人？）|#0203Adv10_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我转身向画室走去，<br>在门前站定。|#0203Adv10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我握住门把，<br>正打算开门的时候——|#0203Adv10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你先冷静下来，安安！|#0203Adv10_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:少、少废话……！|#0203Adv10_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:门后传来剑拔弩张的声音，<br>让我不由得倒吸一口凉气。|#0203Adv10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:快、快住手……！|#0203Adv10_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的语气很迫切。<br>那不是普通争执时会发出的声音。|#0203Adv10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0203Adv10_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

; 木製の扉が勢いよく開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_137 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:0 AppearanceAndTransition:29_2

