@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_25_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:察觉到房间内险恶的气氛，<br>我急忙破门而入。|#0203Adv10_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:房间里一片狼藉。<br>艾玛跟安安正纠缠在一起。|#0203Adv10_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1,Angle01/Option_Arms-,Angle01/Option_ArmR-,ArmR5,ArmL11

[PrintTextModified Text:住、住手，安安！<br>你为什么要这样做……！？|#0203Adv10_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……闭嘴！|#0203Adv10_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唔，唔唔……|#0203Adv10_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安带着一脸阴沉且充满杀气的神色<br>揪住艾玛。|#0203Adv10_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而艾玛则是一脸拼死抵抗的模样，<br>勉强抵抗住安安的袭击。|#0203Adv10_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安手中闪过一道黯淡亮光。<br>她反手握着一把小刀。|#0203Adv10_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:锐利的刀锋正向着艾玛刺去。<br>|#0203Adv10_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到这一幕的瞬间，<br>我下意识冲了过去。|#0203Adv10_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,ArmR12,ArmL12

[PrintTextModified Text:你们在做什么！？|#0203Adv10_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Ema
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:AnAn

[PrintTextModified Text:看到我的突然出现，<br>安安一声啧舌，放开了艾玛。|#0203Adv10_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:90 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry

[PrintTextModified Text:别来，妨碍吾辈……！|#0203Adv10_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安一边用刀尖指着我，<br>一边慢慢往后退。|#0203Adv10_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:就这么退到阳台那边去了。<br>|#0203Adv10_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:-50 AppearanceAndTransition:29_2
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:到底发生了什么事！？<br>先把刀给我！|#0203Adv10_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry

[PrintTextModified Text:不要……|#0203Adv10_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:55 IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:我抓住安安的手腕，<br>想要强行抢走小刀。|#0203Adv10_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:85 IdAndAppearance:AnAn
@SpawnShake ActorId:Hiro
@SpawnShake ActorId:AnAn
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们互相扭扯着，<br>逐渐向阳台的栏杆靠近。|#0203Adv10_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——放手！！|#0203Adv10_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安不耐烦似的狠狠喊道。<br>就在那一刹那。|#0203Adv10_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:100 IdAndAppearance:AnAn
@HideActors ActorIds:AnAn Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:我突然身体不受控制，<br>一下子放开了抓住她的手。|#0203Adv10_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40,30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1
@SpawnShake

