[PrintTextModified Text:呜……！？|#0203Adv10_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:应该是安安的魔法吧。<br>我的身体不自然地被弹开，<br>顺势跌坐在地上。|#0203Adv10_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 物が落ちる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_17 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:安安似乎也被一股神奇的力量推开，<br>失去平衡，手上的小刀当场跌落。|#0203Adv10_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……！|#0203Adv10_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

