[PrintTextModified Text:（是我，把她推下去了……？）|#0203Adv10_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽说不是故意的，<br>但确实是我的抢夺使她掉了下去。|#0203Adv10_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
