[PrintTextModified Text:认识到这个事实的时候，我倒吸了一口凉气，<br>两眼发黑。|#0203Adv10_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCamera Offset:3,0 Zoom:0.3 Duration:0 Lazy:false
