[PrintTextModified Text:安安，你没事……！？|#0203Adv10_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也来到阳台上，<br>我们探头越过栏杆往下看去。|#0203Adv10_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

