[PrintTextModified Text:在夜色的掩盖下，<br>我们无法看清安安身在何处。|#0203Adv10_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可我们依然睁大眼睛，在黑暗中拼命地寻找——|#0203Adv10_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0203Adv10_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:找到了。<br>可悲的是，我们找到了。|#0203Adv10_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:找到了夜色中微微浮现的【那东西】。|#0203Adv10_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

