[PrintTextModified Text:阳台下方，中庭内安装着栅栏。<br>被栅栏从后背贯穿的是……|#0203Adv10_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:夏目安安——|#0203Adv10_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是因为跌落造成的冲击，好几根栅栏都弯折了。|#0203Adv10_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从她那仰面朝天的身躯穿刺而出的，<br>是一根长枪般尖锐的栅栏尖端。<br>|#0203Adv10_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算距离这么远也能一眼看出，<br>那就是贯穿安安的致命伤。|#0203Adv10_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从安安胸口喷涌而出的血液，<br>把地面染成一片鲜红。|#0203Adv10_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛被图钉固定住的蝴蝶标本一般。<br>|#0203Adv10_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会这样……安安！？|#0203Adv10_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛大概也看到了尸体。她悲痛地喊着。|#0203Adv10_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills,Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:是我……是我杀了她。|#0203Adv10_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:29_2

[PrintTextModified Text:视野里的一切在颠簸。<br>脑子里一片空白，完全无法思考。|#0203Adv10_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:恍惚间似乎听到有人在呼唤我。<br>但我无法理解那到底是谁，<br>到底说了些什么。|#0203Adv10_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:当回过神来时，我发现自己身在画室内。|#0203Adv10_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来是艾玛把我从阳台拉进来了。<br>|#0203Adv10_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（艾玛呢？艾玛到底在干什么……？）|#0203Adv10_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛在阳台。<br>我呆滞地抬头望向夜空。|#0203Adv10_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:零星的水滴从天而降，<br>仿佛天空也在叹息。|#0203Adv10_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一滴，两滴。<br>水滴画出的线条渐渐变得密集起来，<br>耳边是水滴接连不断敲打地面的声音。|#0203Adv10_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 激しい雨音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_8_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

@ResetText

; 金属を叩く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_79 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:就像要抓住这个机会似的，<br>在雨声的掩护下，艾玛开始用力踢打阳台的栏杆。|#0203Adv10_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无法理解艾玛在干什么。<br>现在的我无法正常思考，连站都站不起来。|#0203Adv10_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:倾泻而下的雨声回荡着，<br>不断搅乱我的心绪。|#0203Adv10_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
; 暴れて破壊する音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_61 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是因为早已老旧失修，<br>在艾玛不断踢打之下，<br>栏杆终于彻底损坏了。|#0203Adv10_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛捡起地上的刀子，<br>回到画室内。|#0203Adv10_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:她开始收拾房间，<br>像是要把争执的痕迹全部去除一样。|#0203Adv10_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的脸颊满是水痕。|#0203Adv10_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是屋檐也无法遮挡的雨水，<br>还是她流下的泪水呢。<br>也许两者都有。|#0203Adv10_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊，哈啊……|#0203Adv10_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在她拼命忙活的时候——|#0203Adv10_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:……啊！|#0203Adv10_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

