[PrintTextModified Text:（艾玛这么拼命，到底是为了什么——）|#0203Adv10_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:目睹安安的死亡后，<br>即使满面泪痕，<br>但艾玛仍在拼命地干活。|#0203Adv10_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为了谁——）|#0203Adv10_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

